edi-btrfs-firstboot(1) -- Embedded Development Infrastructure BTRFS Rootfs Tools
================================================================================

## SYNOPSIS

`edi-btrfs-firstboot`

## DESCRIPTION

Small utility that helps to adjust the btrfs snapshots on the first boot.

